    <string name="help_common">Common questions</string>
    <string name="help_q1">How do I move in a 3D scene?</string>
    <string name="help_a1">Drag with your left thumb to walk and with your right thumb to look around. Aim the centre circle at an object, pick a tool from the bar, then press the action button.</string>
    <string name="help_q2">How do I join my class?</string>
    <string name="help_a2">Ask your professor for the class code, then enter it in the Join a class card on the Home page.</string>
    <string name="help_q3">Can I study without internet?</string>
    <string name="help_a3">Yes. Modules and lessons you have opened are saved on your phone. Graded quizzes and assessments need an internet connection.</string>
    <string name="help_q4">Why is AR unavailable on my phone?</string>
    <string name="help_a4">AR needs a phone that supports Google Play Services for AR. Every phone can still use the 3D evidence viewer.</string>
    <string name="help_q5">The 3D scene feels slow. What can I do?</string>
    <string name="help_a5">Open Settings, then Video and performance, and choose a lower graphics quality. Closing other apps also helps.</string>
    <string name="help_q6">I have a question about a lesson.</string>
    <string name="help_a6">Tap the AI assistant button on the Home page, or ask your professor.</string>
