    <string name="ob_ai_title">AI tutor: privacy &amp; data</string>
    <string name="ob_ai_1">Forensim\'s AI tutor uses a third-party AI model (Anthropic) to answer questions about your lessons.</string>
    <string name="ob_ai_2">When you ask something, your question, the recent conversation and relevant lesson excerpts are sent to answer you. If you ask about your progress, a short summary of your recent results is included.</string>
    <string name="ob_ai_3">We don\'t store the text of your questions or the tutor\'s answers on our servers, only a usage record to apply daily limits.</string>
    <string name="ob_ai_4">AI answers can be wrong. Check important points against your lessons and your professor. During a graded quiz or case, the tutor is locked.</string>
